{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"],"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with "},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and read it anywhere inside with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the child tasks it starts, but not callbacks a framework runs on tasks of its own, such as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","isActive":true},{"text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":", and queues","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","isActive":true},{"text":" waits for the worker to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catch up; ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","isActive":true},{"text":" does too, then ends the records.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the waits of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process exits. A tracker given a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RecordStore"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"t